  "details": "Starting this week, some videos are failing to play for a similar reason to [last time](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1275-some-youtube-videos-not-loading).\n\n```\n\n./yt-dlp.exe --no-check-certificate --no-cache-dir --rm-cache-dir -f \"mp4[height<=?720][height>=?64][width>=?64]/best[height<=?720][height>=?64][width>=?64]\" --get-url https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1gumADVpaVY\n\nWARNING: [youtube] 1gumADVpaVY: nsig extraction failed: You may experience throttling for some formats\n\n         Install PhantomJS to workaround the issue. Please download it from https://phantomjs.org/download.html\n\n         n = AgACbu2wK8NZ53OV7mCVtg ; player = https://www.youtube.com/s/player/dac945fd/player_ias.vflset/en_US/base.js\n\nhttps://rr1---sn-bvvbax-cvnl.googlevideo.com/videoplayback?expire=1675315703&…\n\n```\n\nyt-dlp is successful and VRChat [incorrectly determines that an error occurred](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/some-youtube-videos-cannot-be-played).\n\nKnown bad videos:\n\n- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1gumADVpaVY\n\n- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jo3OB0F0Rs4\n\n- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lP4dW_YpR3Y\n\n- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UtOu6TDLO6c\n\n- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K8_avXvZd0s\n\n- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jelNkU4mPuA\n\nHowever, the problem seems to sometimes occur temporarily for other videos. I don't know if these listed videos sometimes work and sometimes don't but they didn't work earlier in VRChat and they still exhibit the same behavior now.",
